		"Name": "Battlemaster",
		"Details": "Designed by the SLDF's design bureaus during the Star League's golden age, the BLR-15R is a wild design that uptons the venerable Battlemaster to a full 100 tons, matching that of the Atlas and King Crab. The design never saw production in the Star League era due to budget cuts and the Amaris Civil War, but it was rediscovered by House Cameron in the 3050s and was put into limited production as a new line combat design for the Terran Hegemony elite regiments. It is armed with a LB-10X Autocannon, a LRM-20 with Artemis IV fire control, twin Light PPCs, and four ER Medium Lasers. The armor is thick and the design is relatively fast for its size thanks to a 400-rated XL engine. 16 DHS keep it all chilly without issues.\n\n <b><color=#e51717>COMMUNITY CONTENT</color></b>",
		"Icon": "uixTxrIcon_battlemaster"
